jemTQgC5FugQ7kNvwG1cvx3&_nc_oc=AdqJQ8c40Oa-V-tzINGtCkjixMFncYSm0eSc8QG66LM4PwBoVtOkZcW_kbcTOsZCdcs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af94u2yuzkKsrKae8B2hTOKWz0RCG8t5GcCC4c6VExX2gg&oe=6A47C3B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=muUQtRGZdTYQ7kNvwEl01Ne&_nc_oc=AdpoHAwmkfM76TbnxwiaAT-8k51TKJu7d1IWQF5lz63sVswUEE8Ul4mI-sT1X6dIGKY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8cW-qOHTiDOcutCjSVNe7ZhnMzJWSB9X1fuvcBn6eNiQ&oe=6A47C54A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=neAB7ZcpMmsQ7kNvwFcnu9Q&_nc_oc=AdqqiALerY4i3rWeoAeJyR8rlCxgjwq6VKUgYwiRui0PFUoWF1HTH5gzT4bCKqfYJHA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_cpRu54l4Dd1v9-KYRfoQ3mCXYb-29JhYn9YrY03tOZQ&oe=6A47B26F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Exxgpq2_nf8Q7kNvwH9y6TO&_nc_oc=AdohvyfuaHTOhbPpjzKRjqlwgwI1lvuRxY7MMc79mIgOmf3fnO6fuRc8oYY0OhN9WKE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9vEUIO0k2VGNYJ2c4pu2JUypmDHb4Vha1lMfiix53rhg&oe=6A47D403"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LOvSsluL-JEQ7kNvwFgh32_&_nc_oc=AdoWLGNsVA097oldTb4k4VCNeHjd6SN-VadYzVMtnG2PKqqCYCbpxyGpXv0CIHP80BI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_tnsJjNQ3Uf3moN4KokuJTB6ptB9c0zCR_RZgRIF3qSA&oe=6A47CC58"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BM2FbvN1b-YQ7kNvwHBmyPL&_nc_oc=AdqVQONLaY-WnYt7YoKM6e6rZiKSrwU162lYzWdNen23r4HQAVjQfVEeC0Np75PcJ3E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-VZ0BEkW8FpFKyjtbLB9T8AZ-5ZJv1tC9Jt2QqjJ_k3g&oe=6A47DF7C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080